> User Soontobesetttles (285587)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":false,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":4,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":554,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1892070,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":279720,"Name":"GingerBride","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279720.jpg?_r=1412546963","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1428363178,"LastPoster":{"Id":279400,"Name":"Christinedrc","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":7,"Preview":{"Id":1892070,"PostDate":1428363178,"PostContent":"Mexico brides! \u00a0I have a question, has anyone ever been to the Maya Mall at the Barcelo resorts?...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stimaberry@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.212.163.15","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410094521,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279720.jpg?_r=1412546963","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GingerBride","Id":279720,"Name":"GingerBride","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.224.109.228","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79029,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b52e9e75231eabfb05ca62ebccaf3bc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Mexico brides! &amp;nbsp;I have a question, has anyone ever been to the Maya Mall at the Barcelo resorts?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am curious if it&#039;s just a mall for clothing or is there a market as well that I can purchase some local wedding favours for my guests. &amp;nbsp;I ordered some starfish from the US and now I&#039;m worried that a) they will not get delivered to me in Canada as d&#039;uh they were an animal and b) I probably won&#039;t be able to bring them in to Mexico. &amp;nbsp;I am not too upset by this as I will gladly keep them all for my Christmas tree!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;However, I still would like to have a nice gift for my guests and why not support the locals and save on filling my luggage!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any information would be greatly appreciated! &amp;nbsp;Thank you!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892070,"PostDate":1428363178,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Mexico brides! \u00a0I have a question, has anyone ever been to the Maya Mall at the Barcelo resorts?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am curious if it's just a mall for clothing or is there a market as well that I can purchase some local wedding favours for my guests. \u00a0I ordered some starfish from the US and now I'm worried that a) they will not get delivered to me in Canada as d'uh they were an animal and <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/cool.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt='B)' \/> I probably won't be able to bring them in to Mexico. \u00a0I am not too upset by this as I will gladly keep them all for my Christmas tree!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>However, I still would like to have a nice gift for my guests and why not support the locals and save on filling my luggage!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any information would be greatly appreciated! \u00a0Thank you!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stimaberry@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.212.163.15","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410094521,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279720.jpg?_r=1412546963","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GingerBride","Id":279720,"Name":"GingerBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.72.4.186","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79029,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c3bb6c56c0209d0a3228b764fbafcc75","RawContent":"I am getting married at the palace and apparently there is a gift shop in the lobby area each of the hotels as well as the Maya mall. I specifically asked my wedding coordinator if they sold maracas and she responded back with pricing. I&#039;m assuming they sell all sorts of souvenirs.","Attachments":[],"Id":1892220,"PostDate":1428451575,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am getting married at the palace and apparently there is a gift shop in the lobby area each of the hotels as well as the Maya mall. I specifically asked my wedding coordinator if they sold maracas and she responded back with pricing. I'm assuming they sell all sorts of souvenirs. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tinsisienmay@gmail.com","IpAddress":"184.71.74.195","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413556355,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"starbx123","Id":280691,"Name":"starbx123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.224.109.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79029,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fc1dbd697a36499673fd0432ad6c85e3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"starbx123\"] this is great news! &amp;nbsp;Thanks so much! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I haven&#039;t gotten to that step with my wedding coordinator yet. &amp;nbsp;Right now I am on the seating plan step. &amp;nbsp;I have to say I have had great service so far from our WC we are working with Tania D.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892285,"PostDate":1428500910,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280691\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280691-starbx123\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">starbx123<\/span><\/a> this is great news! \u00a0Thanks so much! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I haven't gotten to that step with my wedding coordinator yet. \u00a0Right now I am on the seating plan step. \u00a0I have to say I have had great service so far from our WC we are working with Tania D.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stimaberry@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"24.212.163.15","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1410094521,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279720.jpg?_r=1412546963","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"GingerBride","Id":279720,"Name":"GingerBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.180.207","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79029,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"10b38044ec7e95555fa9a2bd69501af0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Ladies! If anyone is looking for an affordable and great quality photographer, I would definitely look into using Octavio Montes! www.octaviomontes.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We got married at the Barcelo Maya Palace Deluxe in June 2015. We found that Octavio&#039;s prices were FAR better and more affordable than the resort photographer. Even though you have to pay an outside vendor fee at the resort, we found that it was still cheaper to use Octavio....and you get so many more pictures and options. The resort photographer is honestly too expensive for getting hardly any pictures. The pictures came out amazing. We got everything that we asked for! Octavio was always available for questions and always answered quickly. It is very hard to plan a wedding from afar, but Octavio made it simple! I had no doubt that working with him would be wonderful, and it really was everything I hoped for!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Please let me know if you want any more information!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908309,"PostDate":1449877924,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Ladies! If anyone is looking for an affordable and great quality photographer, I would definitely look into using Octavio Montes! www.octaviomontes.com<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We got married at the Barcelo Maya Palace Deluxe in June 2015. We found that Octavio's prices were FAR better and more affordable than the resort photographer. Even though you have to pay an outside vendor fee at the resort, we found that it was still cheaper to use Octavio....and you get so many more pictures and options. The resort photographer is honestly too expensive for getting hardly any pictures. The pictures came out amazing. We got everything that we asked for! Octavio was always available for questions and always answered quickly. It is very hard to plan a wedding from afar, but Octavio made it simple! I had no doubt that working with him would be wonderful, and it really was everything I hoped for!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Please let me know if you want any more information!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christine.e.darcy@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.126.180.88","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407796912,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Christinedrc","Id":279400,"Name":"Christinedrc","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79029","Title":"Barcelo Maya Palace Deluxe - Maya Mall","LastPostDate":1449877924},"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
