0 and having real difficulty finding somewhere which doesn&#039;t charge so much per person for everything when you have that many guests. Any reviews of brides who&#039;ve successfully had a few more than 10 people with them would be so helpful.\n\n\nThank you","Attachments":[],"Id":1908110,"PostDate":1449239841,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am looking at the Viceroy Sugar Beach and others on St. Lucia for a wedding of about 40 and having real difficulty finding somewhere which doesn't charge so much per person for everything when you have that many guests. Any reviews of brides who've successfully had a few more than 10 people with them would be so helpful.<br><br>\nThank you\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"harriet.a.milligan.05@aberdeen.ac.uk","IpAddress":"92.22.37.211","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1449239590,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285517.jpg?_r=1450064364","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"HarrietM","Id":285517,"Name":"HarrietM","IsOnline":false}}],"Id":"79781","Title":"St Lucia Wedding Anyone Had A Good Experience To Share","LastPostDate":1449239841},"Pages":{"TotalItems":1,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
