{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.134.156.219","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75976,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c700477c4ba64ae362141e37f0efc0fc","RawContent":"So I hada Q\/A with my off site coordinator.   I&#039;ll post later in few days when I get back from my weekend trip","Attachments":[],"Id":1841143,"PostDate":1396050371,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                So I hada Q\/A with my off site coordinator.   I'll post later in few days when I get back from my weekend trip\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mishtb96@aol.com","IpAddress":"162.231.9.34","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1383053267,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-274657.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"misbosox","Id":274657,"Name":"misbosox","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"80.254.146.132","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75976,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fa39a8530e6cd724aeda69e90a1f410b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi, I&#039;m thinking of booking the Moon Palace for a 2015 wedding at the end of this month but I&#039;m worried that the reception is going to end up costing a fortune.&amp;nbsp; There will be approximately 45 guests attending, could anyone give me an idea of costs for the menus they offer please?&amp;nbsp; I would really like a private function so a BBQ buffet or something like that would be of interest.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Leanne&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843014,"PostDate":1396872706,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi, I'm thinking of booking the Moon Palace for a 2015 wedding at the end of this month but I'm worried that the reception is going to end up costing a fortune.\u00a0 There will be approximately 45 guests attending, could anyone give me an idea of costs for the menus they offer please?\u00a0 I would really like a private function so a BBQ buffet or something like that would be of interest.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Leanne<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leanne.john@brenntag.co.uk","IpAddress":"80.254.146.132","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396860295,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"lenny","Id":277495,"Name":"lenny","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"65.196.51.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75976,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cb44b1b87226190bdf06dda774301bb6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Great questions! I have many of the same ones. Can&#039;t wait to see what your coordinator said. Mine hasn&#039;t been any help at all.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1843251,"PostDate":1396980994,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Great questions! I have many of the same ones. Can't wait to see what your coordinator said. Mine hasn't been any help at all.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shellsal1@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"65.196.51.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1388167792,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275746.jpg?_r=1417599111","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shellsal","Id":275746,"Name":"shellsal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"8.26.184.30","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75976,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c651f62dbaf9ab7875f739acc2cfd2c0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats Ladies! Any palace resort is a great choice! I got married in 2012 at Sun Palace and stayed at Moon Palace- let me know if you have any questions!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1855733,"PostDate":1403026163,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats Ladies! Any palace resort is a great choice! I got married in 2012 at Sun Palace and stayed at Moon Palace- let me know if you have any questions!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shanna0487@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"63.122.89.3","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1294260274,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235127.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shan0487","Id":235127,"Name":"shan0487","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":false,"ShowEmoticons":false,"IpAddress":"65.92.173.151","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75976,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1433987931,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7a80f236cbd99da31bcb07bdd7eb8c57","RawContent":"Hi all!\n\nI&#039;m getting married at moon palace in April 2016! Just wondering if it makes sense to book rooms\/suites through the resort directly or via a travel agent? Estimating about 55-60 people.\n\nNot sure what to do? Any thoughts please! \ud83d\ude15","Attachments":[],"Id":1898344,"PostDate":1433987548,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi all!<br>\nI'm getting married at moon palace in April 2016! Just wondering if it makes sense to book rooms\/suites through the resort directly or via a travel agent? Estimating about 55-60 people.<br>\nNot sure what to do? Any thoughts please! \ud83d\ude15\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"Blessings","Email":"leveeneandewen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"65.92.173.151","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1433986301,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"LEVEENE","Id":283483,"Name":"LEVEENE","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"62.172.139.39","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75976,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95e19b5744ec1c72acb8defe95d2b481","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;New to this. &amp;nbsp;I am getting married at Moon Palace in October this year, I can&#039;t wait!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Where is the best place to have the reception, we have chosen the caribbean terrace so far. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also did you have a plated meal or buffet for reception?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1900393,"PostDate":1436866862,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi<\/p>\n<p>New to this. \u00a0I am getting married at Moon Palace in October this year, I can't wait!!<\/p>\n<p>Where is the best place to have the reception, we have chosen the caribbean terrace so far. \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also did you have a plated meal or buffet for reception?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"surekha_18@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"62.172.139.39","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1436795992,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"SUREKHA","Id":283937,"Name":"SUREKHA","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75976,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b39418733dfcf3812f35a11a3a89f989","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi BDW,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We just won top Travel Agent and other numerous awards from Palace. We also are negotiating exclusive for our clients only. &amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79662-wright-travel-agency-wins-top-honors-at-palace-resorts-second-annual-g\/#entry1906561&#039;&gt;Wright Travel Agency Top Palace Travel Agency&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Contact us for more info:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/plan-your-destination-wedding?lp-variation-id=0&amp;amp;keyword=BDWWTA&#039;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contact Link&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Email: info@wrighttravelagency.com&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906562,"PostDate":1445271264,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi BDW,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We just won top Travel Agent and other numerous awards from Palace. We also are negotiating exclusive for our clients only. \u00a0<strong><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79662-wright-travel-agency-wins-top-honors-at-palace-resorts-second-annual-g\/#entry1906561' class='bbc_url' title=''>Wright Travel Agency Top Palace Travel Agency<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Contact us for more info:<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/plan-your-destination-wedding?lp-variation-id=0&keyword=BDWWTA' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><strong>Contact Link<\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: info@wrighttravelagency.com<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts Winner \"Top Travel Agent\", \"Top Homebased Travel Agency\" PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137224220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"179.53.144.236","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75976,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1445352075,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d2e76dd550ba74fb900e7271221a582","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi SUREKHA......just checking in with you to see whether you&#039;ve already had your Oct wedding at Moon Palace - or it&#039;s still coming up?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope it all goes just the way you envision....or Even BETTER!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;To show you another UK couple&#039;s MP wedding, here&#039;s our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151930921014487.1073741866.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Moon Palace Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt;, with some excerpts here.....enjoy :)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/1404421_10151930921414487_1941082145_o.jpg\" alt=\"1404421_10151930921414487_1941082145_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/1403616_10151930921779487_172521250_o.jpg\" alt=\"1403616_10151930921779487_172521250_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/1401724_10151930925634487_219052324_o.jpg\" alt=\"1401724_10151930925634487_219052324_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xlp1\/t31.0-8\/1415241_10151930926689487_1675104903_o.jpg\" alt=\"1415241_10151930926689487_1675104903_o.j\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1397211_10151930925669487_283787287_o.jpg\" alt=\"1397211_10151930925669487_283787287_o.jp\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Wishing you a WONDERFUL journey ahead - CHEERS!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1906618,"PostDate":1445351919,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi SUREKHA......just checking in with you to see whether you've already had your Oct wedding at Moon Palace - or it's still coming up?<\/p>\n<p>Hope it all goes just the way you envision....or Even BETTER!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>To show you another UK couple's MP wedding, here's our <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10151930921014487.1073741866.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Moon Palace Wedding Album<\/a>, with some excerpts here.....enjoy <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/1404421_10151930921414487_1941082145_o.jpg\" alt=\"1404421_10151930921414487_1941082145_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/1403616_10151930921779487_172521250_o.jpg\" alt=\"1403616_10151930921779487_172521250_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xap1\/t31.0-8\/1401724_10151930925634487_219052324_o.jpg\" alt=\"1401724_10151930925634487_219052324_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xlp1\/t31.0-8\/1415241_10151930926689487_1675104903_o.jpg\" alt=\"1415241_10151930926689487_1675104903_o.j\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-iad3-1.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xpa1\/t31.0-8\/1397211_10151930925669487_283787287_o.jpg\" alt=\"1397211_10151930925669487_283787287_o.jp\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>Wishing you a WONDERFUL journey ahead - CHEERS!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280210660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.73.96.37","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":75976,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dcf34b7dbef666e44623dac9088084e0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are also getting married at the moon palace in 2017 and need some help planning. Any advice would be great.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1908332,"PostDate":1450061431,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are also getting married at the moon palace in 2017 and need some help planning. Any advice would be great.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"caverswed2016@gmail.com","IpAddress":"70.73.96.37","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1449418020,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"clmattie","Id":285528,"Name":"clmattie","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":19,"TotalPages":2,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":10},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
